From: 宋青 <songqing.sq@alibaba-inc.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Build libnl3 with shared native rules and installation TARs

FRR needs declared parser generation, SONiC source fixes and SDK/runtime
TARs from libnl3 3.7.0. Apply the reviewed native Bazel implementation after
the existing 3.7.0.sonic.6 overlays, retaining the Debian source archive
and original nexthop patch. Keep the split-package and debug regressions.

Co-authored-by: Guohan Lu <securely1g@gmail.com>
